Subject: Request for audit consideration: OPRD volunteer-program controls

CAUTION: This email originated from outside the Legislature. Use caution cl=
icking any links or attachments.

Some people who received this message don't often get email from rsw@rswfir=
e.com<mailto:rsw@rswfire.com>. Learn why this is important<https://aka.ms/L=
earnAboutSenderIdentification>
Attached is my letter to the committee, dated September 23, 2026, requestin=
g that the committee recommend a performance audit of Oregon State Parks vo=
lunteer-program controls. The same request has been before the Secretary of=
 State's Audits Division since September 21, 2026.
Please acknowledge receipt.
Robert Samuel White


